From e96e16fa62dac8aeec8cfd727796ce8ee3922ceb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 21:58:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08174/11362] [outer-loop] ARC generalization floor:
 adapter-free L1 acquisition falls 24/25 -> 10/25 (p=0.000122); scored-path
 identity removal is inert

Executes CLAUDE.md's ARC-AGI-3 Generalization-Testing Floor (2026-07-17) on both
canonical live entrypoints. CPU only, LLM off, no GPU, no game played, nothing
submitted. Pre-registered before the sweep in
docs/research-notes/arc-heldout-identity-prereg-2026-08-03.md.

The task's premise needed correcting first: an independently computed import
closure confirms arc_game_adapters is ABSENT from the 55-file scored
E3AgentPolicy closure, so "turn the adapter off" is a no-op there. The two
halves are therefore measured separately.

DEV TWIN (arc_loop_solve, first-level acquisition, reproduction-gated):
  adapter ON  banks L1 on 24/25 games
  adapter FREE banks L1 on 10/25 at the shipped 6000-expansion budget,
               14/25 at 5x. 11 games resist 5x more search.
  sign test at GAME clustering: 0 better / 11 ties / 14 worse, p=0.000122,
  which equals the minimum reachable p for 14 discordant pairs.
  On every game it does solve, the generic explorer finds the SAME move count
  as the adapter -- the deficit is search reach, not solution quality.

SCORED PATH (E3AgentPolicy, 400 actions, id-keyed knowledge removed):
  0 of 25 games discordant, 72 of 75 matched action traces BYTE-IDENTICAL, so
  no p was reachable and the null is bounded, not negative. Leak delivery was
  instrumented at each callee with the caller read off the stack: A1-A6 fire in
  all 75 control cells and the sharpest (the game's own registry win-condition
  prose used as the retrieval query) fires 0 times in the held-out arm, so the
  treatment provably removed it. Cause recorded: only ["strategy"] is ever read
  back off approach_recommendation, and it differs on 2 of 25 games.

Seeds 1/2/3 are bit-identical in both arms -- 3 seeds is 1 effective replicate,
recorded rather than left to look like variance. 0 cells explored out, so no
frontier collapse is hiding in any action count.

results/arc_e3 read-only throughout; models/, gap_fills/ and ops/ verified
unmutated after every sweep.
